{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 GEAR UP, FLY, LOOT, DRIVE, SHOOT, SURVIVE!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam23_1._0000-0270_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LEGEND BATTLES\u00a0is the next-gen, ultra-realistic, free-to-play massive\u00a0Battle Royale\u00a0game to fight in a gigantic 400 km\u00b2 open world. Engage in breathtaking combat across\u00a0hundreds of futuristic metropolises, all rendered with stunning detail using\u00a0Unreal Engine 5.5. Every building is fully explorable, with detailed interior environments that bring depth and realism to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a vast arsenal of weapons\u2014heavy machine guns, revolvers, grenades, tactical knives, and more. Roam the battlefield in\u00a0destructible vehicles\u00a0including race cars, dirt bikes, off-roaders, and custom pickup trucks, all navigating an expansive road network across\u00a0rugged desert mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LEGEND BATTLES\u00a0isn't just a game; it's a\u00a0total combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0GEAR UP - CUSTOMIZE YOUR STYLE BEFORE THE BATTLE</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam16_all._0000-0208_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before jumping into the action,\u00a0gear up in the lobby\u00a0by choosing your avatar from a selection of ultra-realistic\u00a0metahumans: Beauty, Survivor, Warrior, Cyberpunk, Sci-Fi, or Carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your identity with\u00a0millions of interchangeable clothing combinations, and personalize your gear with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destructible vehicle skins\u00a0with unique styles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Professional weapon skins\u00a0to stand out on the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0LEGEND BATTLES, the fight begins before the first shot.\u00a0Your look is your signature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0FLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/\u98de\u884c_23m.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take off aboard a colossal spaceship, then dive toward your strategic zone with your squad whether in duo, trio, or full team or go in solo, equipped with your flight suit for a dramatic entrance into the heart of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/Cam_28_all._0000-0914_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather all your gear, weapons, and ammo as soon as you land while staying alert for enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0DRIVE BY LAND, AIR, AND WATER</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam20_1._0000-0372_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a wide range of vehicles: helicopters, armored cars, racing cars, city cars, off-road 4x4s, exo-cars, pickups, vans, racing, custom and dirt motorbikes, and even heavy trucks. Zipline across rooftops, parachute from dizzying heights, or dive underwater to stealthily outmaneuver your enemies. In LEGEND BATTLES, every meter is a playground... and a battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 SHOOT IN A MULTIDIMENSIONAL BATTLEFIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam26_all._0001-0478_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot enemies on the move from your vehicle at full speed or ambush them in dark alleys with deadly precision. The metropolises of LEGEND BATTLES immerse you in a five-dimensional combat universe: outdoor environments, building interiors, underground zones, rooftop engagements, and even on spaceships. Strategically placed ziplines span every megacity, enabling rapid strikes, bold escapes, and stealthy movements. In LEGEND BATTLES, every corner hides danger, every height grants an edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0RESPAWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam27_all._0000-0416__1.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your teammates back to life using the resurrection machine. They'll re-enter the battlefield aboard a hovercraft, then parachute down. Rush to them quickly to supply gear, weapons, and ammunitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional in-game purchases available.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3649730?t=1749603619","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/3bd98c2552d6eaf89764794f591796d8d12826ff/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749603619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/1970a2696aede805c3d7115aa9a72bb99511b084/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749603619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/1970a2696aede805c3d7115aa9a72bb99511b084/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749603619","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 GEAR UP, FLY, LOOT, DRIVE, SHOOT, SURVIVE!</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam23_1._0000-0270_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LEGEND BATTLES\u00a0is the next-gen, ultra-realistic, free-to-play massive\u00a0Battle Royale\u00a0game to fight in a gigantic 400 km\u00b2 open world. Engage in breathtaking combat across\u00a0hundreds of futuristic metropolises, all rendered with stunning detail using\u00a0Unreal Engine 5.5. Every building is fully explorable, with detailed interior environments that bring depth and realism to every encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose from a vast arsenal of weapons\u2014heavy machine guns, revolvers, grenades, tactical knives, and more. Roam the battlefield in\u00a0destructible vehicles\u00a0including race cars, dirt bikes, off-roaders, and custom pickup trucks, all navigating an expansive road network across\u00a0rugged desert mountains.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LEGEND BATTLES\u00a0isn't just a game; it's a\u00a0total combat experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0GEAR UP - CUSTOMIZE YOUR STYLE BEFORE THE BATTLE</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam16_all._0000-0208_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Before jumping into the action,\u00a0gear up in the lobby\u00a0by choosing your avatar from a selection of ultra-realistic\u00a0metahumans: Beauty, Survivor, Warrior, Cyberpunk, Sci-Fi, or Carnival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Express your identity with\u00a0millions of interchangeable clothing combinations, and personalize your gear with:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Destructible vehicle skins\u00a0with unique styles,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Professional weapon skins\u00a0to stand out on the battlefield.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In\u00a0LEGEND BATTLES, the fight begins before the first shot.\u00a0Your look is your signature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0FLY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/\u98de\u884c_23m.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take off aboard a colossal spaceship, then dive toward your strategic zone with your squad whether in duo, trio, or full team or go in solo, equipped with your flight suit for a dramatic entrance into the heart of the battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0LOOT</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/Cam_28_all._0000-0914_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gather all your gear, weapons, and ammo as soon as you land while staying alert for enemy fire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0DRIVE BY LAND, AIR, AND WATER</strong><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam20_1._0000-0372_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of a wide range of vehicles: helicopters, armored cars, racing cars, city cars, off-road 4x4s, exo-cars, pickups, vans, racing, custom and dirt motorbikes, and even heavy trucks. Zipline across rooftops, parachute from dizzying heights, or dive underwater to stealthily outmaneuver your enemies. In LEGEND BATTLES, every meter is a playground... and a battleground.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 SHOOT IN A MULTIDIMENSIONAL BATTLEFIELD</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam26_all._0001-0478_.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Shoot enemies on the move from your vehicle at full speed or ambush them in dark alleys with deadly precision. The metropolises of LEGEND BATTLES immerse you in a five-dimensional combat universe: outdoor environments, building interiors, underground zones, rooftop engagements, and even on spaceships. Strategically placed ziplines span every megacity, enabling rapid strikes, bold escapes, and stealthy movements. In LEGEND BATTLES, every corner hides danger, every height grants an edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0RESPAWN</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3649730/extras/cam27_all._0000-0416__1.gif?t=1749603619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bring your teammates back to life using the resurrection machine. They'll re-enter the battlefield aboard a hovercraft, then parachute down. Rush to them quickly to supply gear, weapons, and ammunitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Optional in-game purchases available.</p>","developers":["Hanxiang"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://share